From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Feb 2026 01:32:09 +0530
Subject: Add addEventListener interception, property existence spoofing,
 window.doNotTrack, postMessage wrappers (Batch 19: 44 APIs)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pattern W — EventTarget.addEventListener interception:
- Modified AddEventListenerInternal() in event_target.cc to check
  window.customOverrides.eventTarget.addEventListenerOverride
- Override receives (eventType) string, returns false to block registration
- Covers 27 event types: device sensors (devicemotion, deviceorientation,
  deviceorientationabsolute, devicelight, deviceproximity, userproximity),
  touch events (touchstart, touchend, touchmove, touchcancel), pointer events
  (pointerdown, pointerup, pointermove, pointerover, pointerout, pointerenter,
  pointerleave), autocomplete events (webkitAutofill, onautocomplete,
  autocomplete), document/media events (visibilitychange, voiceschanged,
  icecandidate), FontFaceSet events (loading, loadingdone, loadingerror)
- Zero overhead when no override is set (fast property lookup returns undefined)
- Only intercepts in main world via DynamicTo<LocalDOMWindow> +
  ToScriptStateForMainWorld guard

Pattern Y — Property existence spoofing:
- Added InstallPropertyExistenceOverrides() in v8_builtin_overrides.cc
- Reads window.customOverrides.propertyExistence at context creation
- Deletes properties from Navigator.prototype (bluetooth, usb, hid, serial,
  keyboard, xr, presentation, credentials), window globals (OrientationSensor,
  ProximitySensor, DocumentTouch, ApplePaySession), and Document.prototype
- 12 properties covered

window.doNotTrack (Pattern A — String return):
- Added [CallWith=ScriptState, ImplementedAs=doNotTrackForBinding] to window.idl
- Delegates to GetFrame()->Client()->DoNotTrackValue() same as navigator.doNotTrack
- Override at window.customOverrides.window.doNotTrackOverride

postMessage wrappers (Pattern V — V8 built-in wrapping):
- Added InstallPostMessageOverrides() in v8_builtin_overrides.cc
- Wraps Worker.prototype.postMessage, BroadcastChannel.prototype.postMessage,
  and MessagePort.prototype.postMessage (covers SharedWorker.port and
  MessageChannel.port1/port2)
- Override signature: (result, ...args) => newResult

Files modified:
- core/dom/events/event_target.cc (Pattern W + includes)
- bindings/core/v8/v8_builtin_overrides.cc (Pattern Y + postMessage)
- core/frame/window.idl (window.doNotTrack attribute)
- core/frame/local_dom_window.h (doNotTrackForBinding declaration)
- core/frame/local_dom_window.cc (doNotTrackForBinding implementation)

